      "mergedPostDetails": "Hi...\n\nThe Label for the Quick Menu Left and Right arrow is wrong.\n\nAs you can see in the screenshot, the Left Arrow labeled \"Report\" and Right Arrow also labeled \"Report\" (Though i didnt take screenshot of the right arrow since it also have the same label).\n\nI think that the Left and Right Arrow should be labeled as \"Previous\" and \"Next\".\n\nThe actual Report button have the correct Label except for these two arrow buttons.",
