  "details": "Description\n\nWhenever pressing a user's profile in a instance, the 2 arrows close to the \"Report User\" button are all labeled \"Report\" in the person's instance profile.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nGo to the instance information, click on any user's name to open their instance profile, the 2 arrows that are supposed to move between instance partipants will be labeled \"Report\". it should be labeled \"Back\" and \"Next\" on the buttons\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
